# MISSION 4 - A SIMPLE JOB
# Introduces driving, vehicle theft, police pursuit and rival gang ambushes.
mission 4
key m04
title "A Simple Job"
desc "A buyer in Ironworks will pay two grand for one specific car: a black Vortex GT parked at Silverline Motors in West Hills. Marcus calls it a simple job. Nothing is ever simple."
start diner 0 -1
requires 3
reward 1200

spawn marcus story marcus @diner 2 8 200 civilian fists stand
name marcus "Marcus Reyes"
invulnerable marcus 1
talk marcus "Talk [E]" "Talk to Marcus"
dialogue m04_brief
give_weapon pistol 45
notify "Pistol acquired. RMB aim, LMB fire, R reload, X/Z switch weapons."
goto @car_lot 0 0 7 "Go to Silverline Motors in West Hills"
vehicle target sports @car_lot 2 -14 90 0.02 0.02 0.025
enter_vehicle target "Steal the black Vortex GT"
wanted 2
music chase
say damian "Alarm. Of course there's an alarm."
notify "Police pursuit! Break line of sight and leave the flashing search zone."
checkpoint
lose_wanted "Lose the police"
music tension
dialogue m04_phone
drive_to @chop_shop 0 -40 14 "Drive the car to Varga's Garage in Ironworks"
group ambush gunman kings 4 @chop_shop 0 -20 9 kings pistol hostile
name ambush "Kings Gunman"
music combat
say thug "That's the boss's car! Light him up!"
kill ambush "The Kings followed you - take them out"
music tension
checkpoint
drive_to @chop_shop 0 3 5 "Drive the car into the garage"
exit_vehicle "Get out of the car"
spawn varga story varga @chop_shop 4 9 200 varga magnum stand
name varga "Nikolai Varga"
invulnerable varga 1
spawn vguard gunman varga_thug @chop_shop 8 7 230 varga smg stand
spawn vguard gunman varga_thug @chop_shop 0 11 160 varga smg stand
name vguard "Varga Bodyguard"
invulnerable vguard 1
talk varga "Talk [E]" "Meet the buyer"
dialogue m04_varga
rep kings -20
rep varga 15
end
